      "slug": "modern/dali-cosmic-elephant-15f04b",
      "text": "Dalí stretches an elephant into a spindly, unstable creature. Its distorted legs turn a familiar animal into an image of dreamlike balance; the captured display support remains visible beneath it."
    },
    {
      "slug": "modern/dali-man-on-a-dolphin-082dca",
      "text": "A rider and dolphin share a sweeping silhouette in this Clot-series composition, also known as Poseidon. The animal carries a mythological figure, bringing the exhibition’s rider-and-animal relationship into Dalí’s dreamlike imagery."
    }
